  unitName: Cowboy Heidt
  unitId: 50092
  unitNumber: 131
  description: A pistoleer from another world that appeared on the outskirts of the
    ruined La Veda Republic. It's said he was a town sheriff. In Grand Gaia he continued
    eliminating villains with his other-worldly pistol, defending the justice he
    believed in. Children imitated him aiming his gun, saying, "I judge the evil
    the law can't reach."
  summonDesc: How rare, a Summoner!<br>Hey, take me with you.<br>I'll bring my pistol
    along.
  fusionDesc: I accept this strength, <br>and promise to use it to <br>protect the
    people.
